WEBVTT

00:14:59.956 --> 00:15:01.379
called the "Three Cs,"

00:15:01.403 --> 00:15:05.653
and it's called commitment,
consciousness and competency.

00:15:05.677 --> 00:15:08.606
And commitment is the desire
to do the right thing

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.613
regardless of the cost.

00:15:10.637 --> 00:15:12.488
In my case at Theranos,

00:15:12.512 --> 00:15:13.663
if I was wrong,

00:15:13.687 --> 00:15:15.868
I was going to have
to pay the consequences.

00:15:15.892 --> 00:15:17.701
But if I was right,

00:15:17.725 --> 00:15:20.321
the fact that I could have been a person

00:15:20.345 --> 00:15:23.893
that knew what was going on
and didn't say something,

00:15:23.917 --> 00:15:25.234
that was purgatory.

00:15:25.258 --> 00:15:27.297
Being silent was purgatory.

00:15:28.766 --> 00:15:30.666
Then there's consciousness,